<InfoLayout title="Contact" description="Editorial, correction and rights contact for Auspicious Music." canonicalPath="/contact/" lede="Write to a real address. There is no decorative form that silently discards messages.">
  <h2 style="margin-top:0">Editorial email</h2>
  <p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="mailto:info@matthiasramahi.de?subject=Auspicious%20Music">info@matthiasramahi.de</a></p>
  <p>Please include the page URL and one of these subjects so the request can be sorted:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Correction</strong> — a factual or technical error</li>
    <li><strong>Rights</strong> — ownership, attribution or former-site material</li>
    <li><strong>Accessibility</strong> — a barrier or compatibility problem</li>
    <li><strong>Editorial</strong> — a proposed source, interview or article question</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Publisher</h2>
  <address>
    Matthias Ramahi<br>
    Kempener Straße 44<br>
    40699 Erkrath<br>
    Germany
  </address>
  <p>Telephone: <a href="tel:+4917642449858">+49 176 42 44 98 58</a></p>

  <h2>What not to send</h2>
  <p>Do not send unsolicited download attachments, plug-in installers or archive files. For a correction or rights claim, send a link and description first. This protects both the sender and the publication from unverified files.</p>
</InfoLayout>
